| An unreachable far side is a value, not a dead program: nothing listens on
| port 1, so this needs no network. The whole contract of a module is that it
| may not end the application — it reports with an Exception instead.

link "native_modules/net_client.so" as net

emit Send { url = "euglena://127.0.0.1:1/demo", particle = Ping {} } to net get r
assert r ∈ Exception
assert r.source = "net_client"
